# Kheru Goldkeeper: "Renew — {2}{B}{G}{U}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Put two +1/+1 counters and a flying counter
# on target creature. Activate only as a sorcery." Bot2 Lightning Bolts Kheru on turn 2, with its Llanowar Elves already out.
# On Bot2's turn the ability is not offered (CR 602.5d). On turn 3 Bot1 pays five Moxen: the Elves become a 3/3 with flying
# (counters, CR 122.1b). Kheru is exiled as the cost, and a card leaving the graveyard does not trigger Kheru, which is in
# that graveyard itself and not on the battlefield: no Treasure.

